# Riot's instances are ordered with the other replacements that modify how a permanent enters (CR 616.1, 702.136b). Under Bot2's
# Authority of the Consuls ("Creatures your opponents control enter tapped"), Bot1's second Spider-Punk has its printed riot and
# the first one's grant: each instance is offered and chosen separately with the Authority's (the order left to the runner),
# so it enters tapped with two +1/+1 counters. The legend rule then keeps the new one.

